# Task splitting and resources

- One logical task per agent session. If the request is large, list short steps and do only the first unless the user asks for more.
- Use todos for multi-step work. Keep tool use targeted: few reads, small edits, one check pass.
- One active agent at a time. Do not open extra Composer/Cloud chats for the same job.
- Close finished chats. Long-running Cloud threads (days/weeks) grow context and drain the pool on every follow-up.
